(6703, 1, 22, 'knowsAbout', 'knowsAbout', 'Of a [[Person]], and less typically of an [[Organization]], to indicate a topic that is known about - suggesting possible expertise but not implying it. We do not distinguish skill levels here, or relate this to educational content, events, objectives or [[JobPosting]] descriptions.'),
(6704, 1, 22, 'opponent', 'opponent', 'A sub property of participant. The opponent on this action.'),
