(6793, 1, 22, 'customerRemorseReturnShippingFeesAmount', 'customerRemorseReturnShippingFeesAmount', 'The amount of shipping costs if a product is returned due to customer remorse. Applicable when property [[customerRemorseReturnFees]] equals [[ReturnShippingFees]].'),
