(6795, 1, 22, 'numberOfFullBathrooms', 'numberOfFullBathrooms', 'Number of full bathrooms - The total number of full and ¾ bathrooms in an [[Accommodation]]. This corresponds to the [BathroomsFull field in RESO](https://ddwiki.reso.org/display/DDW17/BathroomsFull+Field).'),
(6796, 1, 22, 'tourBookingPage', 'tourBookingPage', 'A page providing information on how to book a tour of some [[Place]], such as an [[Accommodation]] or [[ApartmentComplex]] in a real estate setting, as well as other kinds of tours as appropriate.'),
