(6966, 1, 22, 'educationalProgramMode', 'educationalProgramMode', 'Similar to courseMode, the medium or means of delivery of the program as a whole. The value may either be a text label (e.g. \"online\", \"onsite\" or \"blended\"; \"synchronous\" or \"asynchronous\"; \"full-time\" or \"part-time\") or a URL reference to a term from a controlled vocabulary (e.g. https://ceds.ed.gov/element/001311#Asynchronous ).'),
