(6969, 1, 22, 'accessibilityFeature', 'accessibilityFeature', 'Content features of the resource, such as accessible media, alternatives and supported enhancements for accessibility. Values should be drawn from the [approved vocabulary](https://www.w3.org/2021/a11y-discov-vocab/latest/#accessibilityFeature-vocabulary).'),
(6970, 1, 22, 'measuredValue', 'measuredValue', 'The measuredValue of an [[Observation]].'),
