(6974, 1, 22, 'sha256', 'sha256', 'The [SHA-2](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2) SHA256 hash of the content of the item. For example, a zero-length input has value \'e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\''),
(6975, 1, 22, 'creativeWorkStatus', 'creativeWorkStatus', 'The status of a creative work in terms of its stage in a lifecycle. Example terms include Incomplete, Draft, Published, Obsolete. Some organizations define a set of terms for the stages of their publication lifecycle.'),
